  "description": "Gerhion is a sophisticated serif font with charismatic curves, flowing swashes, and distinctive alternate characters.\nDesigned for high-fashion branding and upscale editorial layouts, Gerhion brings graceful energy into every word. Its stylish elegance and flair make it the perfect choice for designers who want luxury, expression, and timeless style in their visuals.\nUse Gerhion to elevate your brand identity, wedding suite, portfolio showcase, or packaging concept — all with a refined twist.\nPerfect For:Luxury fashion brandingMagazine editorial titlesWedding logo & stationeryElegant quotes & headlinesSocial media contentPremium product packaging\nGerhion adds emotion, movement, and class to every design. The font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Gerhion is a sophisticated serif font with charismatic curves, flowing swashes, and distinctive alternate characters.</strong></p>\n<p>Designed for high-fashion branding and upscale editorial layouts, Gerhion brings graceful energy into every word. Its stylish elegance and flair make it the perfect choice for designers who want luxury, expression, and timeless style in their visuals.</p>\n<p>Use Gerhion to elevate your brand identity, wedding suite, portfolio showcase, or packaging concept — all with a refined twist.</p>\n<p><strong>Perfect For:</strong><br>Luxury fashion branding<br>Magazine editorial titles<br>Wedding logo &amp; stationery<br>Elegant quotes &amp; headlines<br>Social media content<br>Premium product packaging</p>\n<p>Gerhion adds emotion, movement, and class to every design. <strong><em>The font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.</em></strong></p>",
